<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-299] Support clearing output for paragraph</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-299</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This is helpful in situations like running a presentation or collaborating on a notebook. We should allow clearing output for an individual paragraph and having the notebook saved.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
