                            <comment id="14975773" author="githubbot" created="Tue, 27 Oct 2015 05:50:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user r-kamath opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/372&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/372&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

